POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "gonzalo@example.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

### Crear examen (reemplazar TOKEN por el JWT del docente)
POST http://localhost:3000/exams
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Primer parcial",
    "description": "Unidades 1 a 3",
    "opensAt": "2026-11-20T12:00:00.000Z",
    "closesAt": "2026-11-20T14:00:00.000Z",
    "durationMinutes": 90,
    "maxAttempts": 1
}

### Listar exámenes del docente
GET http://localhost:3000/exams
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Detalle de un examen
GET http://localhost:3000/exams/EXAM_ID
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Editar borrador: metadatos, grupos y preguntas
PUT http://localhost:3000/exams/EXAM_ID
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Primer parcial",
    "description": "Unidades 1 a 3",
    "opensAt": "2026-11-20T12:00:00.000Z",
    "closesAt": "2026-11-20T14:00:00.000Z",
    "durationMinutes": 90,
    "maxAttempts": 1,
    "groupIds": ["GROUP_ID"],
    "questions": [
        { "questionId": "QUESTION_ID", "points": 2, "position": 1 }
    ]
}

### Cerrar
POST http://localhost:3000/exams/EXAM_ID/close
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
